{"k":{"t01-apar-0":"<span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"12.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">설명 소책자</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"8.4pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">부속</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.6pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">델마 보조 도표</span> <span class=\"orn\">❦</span> <span class=\"ln\" data-korpo=\"13.2pt\" data-rolo=\"serio\">첫째 계열</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-apar-1":"<span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"15.0pt\" data-rolo=\"nom\">도표 제 1 호</span> <span class=\"ln lg\" data-korpo=\"11.4pt\" data-rolo=\"tit\">학교, 고등학교, 교실.</span> <span class=\"fil\"></span>","t01-tit-1":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">전체 설명.</span>","t01-01-1":"1. — 이 도표는 <b>고등학교</b>의 <b>교실</b>을 보여 준다. 이 교실에는 <b>책상</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.339325,0.560105,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"18\" title=\"tabli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(18)</sup></button> 여덟 개와 <b>걸상</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.298491,0.886341,0.009543,0.012447\" data-n=\"32\" title=\"benki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(32)</sup></button> 여덟 개가 있다. 걸상 하나에 학생 세 명이 앉는다. <b>선생님</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.104527,0.503767,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"7\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(7)</sup></button> 께서는 <b>의자</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.072792,0.542745,0.00466,0.012119\" data-n=\"8\" title=\"stulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(8)</sup></button>에 앉으시는데, 그 의자는 당신의 <b>교단</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.134043,0.602358,0.00466,0.011137\" data-n=\"6\" title=\"katedro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(6)</sup></button> 위에 있다.","t01-02-1":"2. — 교단 왼쪽에는 <b>유리장</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>이 <b>끼워져</b> 있다. 오른쪽에는 <b>칠판</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.016644,0.59679,0.003329,0.010481\" data-n=\"1\" title=\"nigra tabelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(1)</sup></button>이 있고, 거기에 <b>칠판지우개</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.034842,0.685228,0.005548,0.010154\" data-n=\"2\" title=\"vishilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(2)</sup></button>와 <b>분필</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.055704,0.744186,0.004882,0.010481\" data-n=\"3\" title=\"kreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(3)</sup></button>이 놓여 있다.","t01-02-2":"교단 위에는 <b>벽걸이 그림표</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.042166,0.4887,0.00466,0.010481\" data-n=\"9\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">9</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">11</button>, <button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\">12</button>)</sup>와 <b>지도</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.117843,0.250901,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"10\" title=\"mapo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(10)</sup></button>가 걸려 있다.","t01-03-1":"3. — 학생이 모두 제 <b>자리</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.290945,0.528005,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"17\" title=\"plaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(17)</sup></button>에 앉아 있는 것은 아니다. 요안네스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.006658,0.712414,0.00577,0.010481\" data-n=\"4\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(4)</sup></button>는 칠판 앞에 서서 <b>지우개</b>를 들고 <b>기하 도형</b>을 지운다.","t01-03-2":"페트루스는 교단 가까이에 있다. 그는 <b>쓰기 과제</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.092543,0.64756,0.005104,0.010809\" data-n=\"5\" title=\"skribo-taski\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(5)</sup></button>를 걷어 선생님께 가져다 드린다.","t01-04-1":"4. — <b>이</b> 선생님은 <b>현대어</b> 담당이시다. 그분은 학생들에게 외국어를 말하고 읽고 쓰는 법을 가르치신다 <b>(독일어, 영어, 스페인어, 이탈리아어, 러시아어</b> 또는 <b>프랑스어)</b>.","t01-05-1":"5. — 교실은 아주 넓고 아주 밝다. 안쪽에는 <b>들창</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.336662,0.236489,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"78\" title=\"postigi\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(78)</sup></button> 두 개가 달린 넓은 <b>창</b>과 <b>유리문</b>이 있어서 바람을 통하게 하고 빛을 들인다.","t01-05-2":"이 교실은 춥지 않다. 한가운데에는 방을 데우려고 아주 좋은 <b>난로</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543054,0.73567,0.011984,0.010809\" data-n=\"46\" title=\"furnelo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(46)</sup></button>가 있는데, 거기에 <b>연통</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.506214,0.622666,0.010431,0.011464\" data-n=\"45\" title=\"tubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(45)</sup></button>이 달려 있다.","t01-05-3":"벽에는 <b>옷걸이</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.908566,0.720275,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"58\" title=\"vest-hoki\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(58)</sup></button>가 박혀 있고, 거기에 학생들의 모자와 외투가 걸려 있다.","t01-tit-2":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">운동장</span>","t01-06-1":"6. — <b>시계</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.781846,0.21225,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"63\" title=\"horlojo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(63)</sup></button>는 아홉 시 오 분을 가리킨다.","t01-06-2":"<b>쉬는 시간</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.38016,0.384212,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"76\" title=\"amuz-tempo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(76)</sup></button>이 막 끝나고 수업이 다시 시작된다. 노는 곳은 <b>운동장</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.36285,0.442516,0.008655,0.010154\" data-n=\"75\" title=\"korto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(75)</sup></button>이다. 놀고 있는 학생 몇이 보인다. <b>감독 선생</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.419441,0.372093,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"74\" title=\"Submaestro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(74)</sup></button>이 그들을 지켜본다.","t01-07-1":"7. — 운동장에서는 여러 사람이 더 보인다. 곧 <b>장학사</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.400355,0.432689,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"73\" title=\"inspektisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(73)</sup></button>, 학교장 <b>(교장)</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.47692,0.431379,0.008655,0.010809\" data-n=\"71\" title=\"(liceestro)\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(71)</sup></button>, 그리고 <b>학감</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.441411,0.428431,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"72\" title=\"censoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(72)</sup></button>이다.","t01-07-2":"장학사는 학교를 살피고, 교장은 고등학교를 이끌고, 학감은 학업을 감독한다.","t01-07-3":"네 번째 사람은 <b>수위</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.33644,0.429414,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"77\" title=\"pordisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(77)</sup></button>다. 그는 결석을 적어 넣으려고 겨드랑이에 장부를 끼고 다닌다.","t01-08-1":"8. — 운동장 안쪽에는 <b>체조 기구</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.467599,0.393384,0.009543,0.009826\" data-n=\"70\" title=\"gimnastikal aparati\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(70)</sup></button>와 <b>수공 작업</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>을 위한 작업실이 있다.","t01-08-2":"도표 오른쪽으로는 <b>음악</b>과 <b>그리기</b> <b>교실</b>이 보이기 시작한다.","t01-tit-3":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">자세한 설명.</span>","t01-tit-4":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">잘하는 학생들.</span>","t01-09-1":"9. — 교단 오른쪽 첫째 걸상의 학생들은 <b>헨리쿠스</b> <button class=\"apel\" data-noto=\"ko-t01-noto-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\">(*)</button>, <b>스테파누스</b>, <b>카롤루스</b>다.","t01-09-2":"헨리쿠스는 아주 주의 깊고 부지런해서 선생님 말씀을 잘 듣는다. 자기 책상 위에 그는 <b>공책</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230581,0.868981,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"28\" title=\"kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(28)</sup></button>, <b>책</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.199068,0.863085,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"29\" title=\"libro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(29)</sup></button>, <b>사전</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.159565,0.891582,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"30\" title=\"lexiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(30)</sup></button>, <b>필통</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.214603,0.905011,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"31\" title=\"skribiluyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(31)</sup></button>을 두고 있다. 그의 책에는 <b>쪽</b>이 많고, 장마다 <b>문단</b>이 여럿이며, <b>줄</b>마다 <b>낱말</b>이 많다.","t01-09-4":"그 옆의 스테파누스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.291389,0.81035,0.012206,0.010154\" data-n=\"24\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(24)</sup></button>는 열심이다. 그는 다음 시간에 배울 것을 자기 공책에 적어 둔다. 그는 <b>글씨체</b>가 곱다. 그의 책은 덮여 있어서 우리 눈에는 <b>표지</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.201287,0.804455,0.010431,0.010809\" data-n=\"27\" title=\"kovrilo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(27)</sup></button>만 보인다. 그 곁에는 그의 <b>컴퍼스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.21771,0.820832,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"26\" title=\"kompaso\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(26)</sup></button>가 놓여 있다.","t01-09-5":"카롤루스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.270084,0.730102,0.009987,0.011137\" data-n=\"23\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(23)</sup></button>는 손으로 자기 책을 들고, 배운 것을 다시 읽으려고 그것을 편다. 그도 학생마다 그렇듯이 제 앞에 <b>잉크병</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.241456,0.717982,0.011318,0.009826\" data-n=\"25\" title=\"inkuyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(25)</sup></button>을 두고 있다. 그는 말을 잘 듣는다.","t01-10-1":"10. — 옆 책상에는 <b>루도비쿠스</b>, <b>안토니우스</b>, <b>파울루스</b>가 있다. 루도비쿠스는 자기 <b>배운 과</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.365291,0.645922,0.010652,0.010481\" data-n=\"22\" title=\"leciono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(22)</sup></button>를 외우고 선생님의 <b>물음</b>에 대답한다. 안토니우스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.329117,0.630855,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"21\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(21)</sup></button>는 아주 주의가 없어서 이따금 선생님께 벌을 받기도 한다. 파울루스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.334665,0.600721,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"20\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(20)</sup></button>는 좋은 <b>동무</b>이고 상냥하며 남을 잘 돕는다. 그는 아주 주의 깊다.","t01-tit-5":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">못하는 학생들.</span>","t01-11-1":"11. — 헨리쿠스 뒤에는 <b>게오르기우스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.543276,0.87455,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"38\" title=\"Georgius\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(38)</sup></button>가 있다. 나쁜 아이는 아니지만 <b>수다스럽고</b> 주의가 없으며 장난이 심하다. 그의 <b>경솔함</b>과 <b>말 안 듣는 버릇</b>은 수업 중에 <b>소란</b>을 일으켜서 자주 호된 <b>꾸중</b>을 듣는다. 그의 <b>연습장</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.486906,0.885686,0.009987,0.010809\" data-n=\"35\" title=\"klado-kayero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(35)</sup></button>은 지저분하다. 그는 자기 <b>펜</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.513316,0.936456,0.011762,0.008516\" data-n=\"34\" title=\"plumo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(34)</sup></button>으로 거기에 <b>잉크를 묻히고</b>, 그래서 늘 <b>지우개</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.478695,0.859155,0.010874,0.011137\" data-n=\"36\" title=\"efacokauchuko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(36)</sup></button>를 쓴다. 그의 <b>공책집</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.454949,0.912217,0.010431,0.012119\" data-n=\"33\" title=\"kayeruyo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(33)</sup></button>은 찢어져 있는데, 그가 아주 조심성이 없기 때문이다. 그런데 왜 그는 현대어 교실에 자기 <b>연필꽂이</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.496671,0.864723,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"37\" title=\"krayoniero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(37)</sup></button>를 들고 오는 걸까?","t01-11-2":"그 옆의 에드문두스 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.53573,0.800852,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"39\" title=\"\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(39)</sup></button>는 그를 좋아하지 않는다. 그는 사실 좀 굼뜨지만 말수가 적고 조용하다. 떠들지 않는다. 다만 듣는 대신에 자기 <b>읽기 책</b>의 <b>이야기</b>를 읽기를 더 좋아한다.","t01-11-3":"이 걸상의 셋째 학생은 <b>루도비쿠스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.483577,0.767114,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"40\" title=\"Ludovikus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(40)</sup></button>다. 그는 부지런하다. 하얀 <b>종이</b>에 글을 쓴다. 제 앞에는 <b>압지</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.432091,0.739928,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"41\" title=\"absorbiva papero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(41)</sup></button>를 놓아 두었다.","t01-12-1":"12. — 선생님 왼쪽 둘째 걸상의 학생들은 아주 어리다. 첫째인 어린 <b>에밀리우스</b>는 아직 글씨를 잘 쓸 줄 몰라서 자기 <b>석판</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.45162,0.655421,0.011318,0.010481\" data-n=\"42\" title=\"ardezo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(42)</sup></button>과 <b>석필</b>과 <b>스펀지</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.627252,0.011096,0.010809\" data-n=\"43\" title=\"sponjo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(43)</sup></button>를 들고 다닌다.","t01-12-2":"그 곁에는 <b>아우구스투스</b>와 <b>베르나르두스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.437195,0.591549,0.011984,0.009499\" data-n=\"44\" title=\"Bernardus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(44)</sup></button>가 있다. 이 아이는 공부는 잘하지만 <b>옷차림</b>이 아주 단정하지 못하다.","t01-13-1":"13. — 그 뒤에는 <b>게으른 아이</b> 셋이 있다. <b>알베르투스</b>는 배운 것을 익히지 않는다. <b>야코부스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.629161,0.611857,0.010874,0.010809\" data-n=\"47\" title=\"Iakobus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(47)</sup></button>는 듣는 대신에 잔다. 그의 <b>게으름</b>은 <b>꾸지람</b>과 <b>벌</b>을 부른다. 끝으로 <b>크리스티아누스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.679982,0.61153,0.009987,0.010154\" data-n=\"48\" title=\"Kristianus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(48)</sup></button>는 너무 진지하지 못하다. 그는 나쁘게 <b>처신하고</b> 고치려고 조금도 애쓰지 않는다.","t01-14-1":"14. — 그와 달리 그 이웃들은 행실이 바르다. <b>에르네스투스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699956,0.702588,0.007989,0.010809\" data-n=\"51\" title=\"Ernestus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(51)</sup></button>는 질서와 규칙을 좋아해서 늘 자기 <b>자</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.692632,0.793318,0.008877,0.010809\" data-n=\"50\" title=\"linealo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(50)</sup></button>와 <b>연필</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.671993,0.744841,0.010209,0.009171\" data-n=\"49\" title=\"krayono\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(49)</sup></button>을 쓴다. 그는 <b>통학생</b>이다.","t01-14-2":"<b>프란치스쿠스</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.780293,0.754012,0.009543,0.011137\" data-n=\"52\" title=\"Franciskus\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(52)</sup></button>는 <b>기숙생</b>이다. 제복을 입고 고등학교에서 먹고 잔다. 그는 좋은 <b>동무</b>다.","t01-14-3":"마우리키우스는 자기 <b>주머니칼</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.786951,0.886341,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"56\" title=\"kulteleto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(56)</sup></button>로 <b>연필</b>을 깎는다. 그는 아주 꼼꼼하다.","t01-14-4":"그는 제 책을 모두 들고 다닌다. 자기 <b>문법책</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.732801,0.892892,0.009543,0.010481\" data-n=\"55\" title=\"gramatiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(55)</sup></button>, 자기 <b>수첩</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.709055,0.857845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"54\" title=\"notlibreto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(54)</sup></button>, 심지어 <b>책받침</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.762761,0.880118,0.010209,0.010481\" data-n=\"53\" title=\"skribkuseno\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(53)</sup></button> 까지. 그의 <b>책가방</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.930537,0.91451,0.010209,0.010809\" data-n=\"57\" title=\"skolsako\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(57)</sup></button>은 뒤쪽 바닥에 놓여 있다.","t01-14-5":"교실 안쪽의 책상 두 개는 <b>우등생</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.337772,0.507042,0.008433,0.010809\" data-n=\"19\" title=\"bona lernanti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(19)</sup></button>들이 쓴다.","t01-tit-6":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">그리기와 음악.</span>","t01-15-1":"15. — <b>미술실</b>에는 벽에 걸린 고운 <b>본</b>들과, <b>갓</b>이 달린 <b>등</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.975144,0.45922,0.009765,0.010809\" data-n=\"62\" title=\"lampo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(62)</sup></button>이 천장에 매달려 있다. <b>선생님</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.81447,0.575827,0.009543,0.011464\" data-n=\"60\" title=\"docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(60)</sup></button>은 아주 참을성이 많으시다. 그분은 학생들의 <b>그림</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.891034,0.610219,0.007324,0.009826\" data-n=\"61\" title=\"desegnuri\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(61)</sup></button>을 고쳐 주시고, 실물을 보고 <b>흉상</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.976476,0.514248,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"59\" title=\"busto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(59)</sup></button> 그리는 법을 가르치신다.","t01-16-1":"16. — <b>음악실</b>은 아주 재미있어 보인다. 거기에서는 <b>악보</b> 읽는 법, <b>오선</b> 위에 적힌 <b>음표</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.753884,0.423845,0.011096,0.010481\" data-n=\"67\" title=\"gamnoti\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(67)</sup></button> 부르는 법(도, 레, 미, 파, 솔, 라, 시 = C. D. E. F. G. A. B.), <b>음자리표</b> 아는 법, 고운 <b>가락</b> 부르는 법을 배운다. 악보는 <b>보면대</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.640257,0.466099,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"65\" title=\"pupitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(65)</sup></button> 위에 놓는다. 학생 하나가 <b>피아노를 치고</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.758766,0.510645,0.010652,0.010809\" data-n=\"64\" title=\"pianopleas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(64)</sup></button>, <b>음악 선생님</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.699512,0.461513,0.009099,0.010809\" data-n=\"66\" title=\"muzik-docisto\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(66)</sup></button>이 <b>박자를 맞춘다</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.725477,0.447101,0.010431,0.010481\" data-n=\"68\" title=\"skandas\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(68)</sup></button>.","t01-17-1":"17. — <b>수공 작업</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.559698,0.471995,0.010874,0.010481\" data-n=\"69\" title=\"manulabori\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(69)</sup></button>을 위한 <b>작업실</b>의 한 귀퉁이가 보이기 시작한다. 거기에서 아이들은 나무를 대패질하고 쇠를 줄질하는 법을 배울 수 있다. 모든 고등학교에 이런 곳이 있는 것은 아니다.","t01-tit-7":"<span class=\"pk\" data-korpo=\"10.2pt\" data-rolo=\"sekc\">과학 교실.</span>","t01-18-1":"18. — 수학 선생님은 학생들에게 <b>기하</b>, <b>산수</b>, <b>셈</b>, <b>미터법</b>을 가르치신다. 칠판 위에는 주된 기하 도형이 보인다 : <b>원</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.019633,0.658661,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"rondo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>정사각형</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052468,0.626557,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"quadrato\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, <b>삼각형</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.049811,0.67077,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"triangulo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>선</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.035173,0.739874,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"lineo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-18-2":"<b>셈 하나</b>도 보인다. 그것은 <b>덧셈</b>도 <b>뺄셈</b>도 <b>곱셈</b>도 아니고, 바로 <b>나눗셈</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.065565,0.676005,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"divido\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>이다.","t01-19-1":"19. — 미터법 도표 위에는 이런 것이 보인다 : <b>미터</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.052217,0.380286,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"metro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, <b>저울</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.015161,0.379639,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"balanco\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>과 그 <b>분동</b>, <b>리터</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.059978,0.343932,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"ponderili, litro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>데카리터</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.013372,0.258796,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"dekalitro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>데시리터</b>, <b>세제곱미터</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.03224,0.324944,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"metral kubo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>.","t01-19-2":"학생들은 <b>자연 과학</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.097426,0.279725,0.007767,0.010481\" data-n=\"11\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(11)</sup></button>, 동물학 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.124098,0.290533,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"zoologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(a)</sup></button>, 식물학 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.132317,0.3652,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"botaniko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(b)</sup></button>, 지질학 <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.127443,0.431354,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"geologio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>, <b>역사</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.170883,0.311824,0.009099,0.010481\" data-n=\"12\" title=\"mural tabeli\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(12)</sup></button>도 배운다.","t01-19-3":"유리장 안에는 <b>물리</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.188859,0.618736,0.008877,0.010481\" data-n=\"15\" title=\"armoro\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(15)</sup></button>와 <b>화학</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.230138,0.5755,0.009321,0.010481\" data-n=\"16\" title=\"kemio\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(16)</sup></button> 기구가 있다.","t01-19-4":"유리장 위에는 <b>구</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.189525,0.419915,0.009987,0.010481\" data-n=\"14\" title=\"sfero\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(14)</sup></button>, <b>원뿔</b>, <b>지구본</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.175322,0.387815,0.010209,0.011464\" data-n=\"13\" title=\"terglobo\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(13)</sup></button>이 있다.","t01-19-5":"도표들 위에는 세계의 다섯 대륙을 보여 주는 <b>지도</b>가 걸려 있다 : <b>유럽</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.161802,0.143808,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"e\" title=\"Europa\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(e)</sup></button>, <b>아시아</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.20951,0.166394,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"g\" title=\"Azia\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(g)</sup></button>, <b>아프리카</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.155821,0.230267,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"f\" title=\"Afrika\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(f)</sup></button>, <b>아메리카</b> <sup>(<button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.073486,0.101258,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"a\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">a</button><button class=\"lupo nuda\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.084585,0.148741,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"b\" title=\"Amerika\" aria-expanded=\"false\">b</button>)</sup>, <b>오세아니아</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.209077,0.256781,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"h\" title=\"Oceania\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(h)</sup></button>, 그리고 두 큰 대양인 <b>태평양</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.036213,0.146461,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"c\" title=\"Pacifiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(c)</sup></button>과 <b>대서양</b> <button class=\"lupo\" data-g=\"t01-apar-1\" data-c=\"0.116538,0.161832,0.0071,0.01048\" data-n=\"d\" title=\"Atlantiko\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><sup>(d)</sup></button>. <span class=\"fil\"></span>"},"noto":{"t01-noto-1":"(*) <i>세례명</i>도 라틴어 꼴에 따라 옮겨 적기를 권한다. 그것만이 헤아릴 수 없는 갈래를 피하는 길이다. 게다가 <i>Giovanni, Jean, Johann, Jan, Hans, John, Ivan</i> 따위 가운데에서 무엇을 고르겠는가? 세례명만을 위한 낱말집을 따로 만들 것인가? 라틴어에서 그 주격을 길어다가 이렇게 말하자 : <b>Ioannes, Ioanna; Iulius, Iulia; Iakobus;</b> <b>Andreas; Lukas.</b> (Gram. Kompleta)."}}
